            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An ESD protection circuit including a TFT (03) arranged between a to-be-protected signal line (01) and a discharging line (02) is provided, wherein a length direction of a channel of the TFT (03) is parallel to an extension direction of the to-be-protected signal line (01). A display panel and a display device are also provided.</p>
